### Chat - coding query
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Write a Python function to reverse a linked list and explain time complexity.",
  "user_id": "demo-user-1",
  "user_tier": "pro"
}

### Chat - analytical query
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Compare Redis and PostgreSQL caching strategies with pros and cons for read-heavy systems.",
  "user_id": "demo-user-2",
  "user_tier": "free"
}

